sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Browser review interface
  participant API as Review API
  participant Gate as Sign-in and project access checks
  participant Proxy as Project access handler
  participant Backend as Image review backend
  participant DB as Image review database
  UI->>API: request + signed sign-in credential + selected project
  API->>Gate: check account, permission, and project access
  Gate-->>API: account and project access confirmed
  API->>Proxy: image or review operation
  Proxy->>Backend: direct call within this running program
  Backend->>DB: read selected project data / record reviewer decision
  DB-->>Backend: saved data or notice that it changed
  Backend-->>API: response
  API-->>UI: result (images outside the project are shown as not found)
  Note over API,Backend: Both review components run inside the same program.
